# Copy to `api.env` on the server, chmod 600, never commit.
# Single file for the flashcards-api container (docker --env-file).

NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3000
JWT_SECRET=replace-with-openssl-rand-hex-32
CORS_ORIGIN=https://kzt24.duckdns.org

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Outgoing mail (one option — see priority in server/mailer.js)
# Direct SMTP from a random VPS IP is rejected by mail.ru, Gmail, etc. as spam.
# Use a trusted relay (A) or your mailbox’s SMTP (B). Self-host Postfix (C)
# only with RELAY/SPF/DKIM or for testing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# (A) Brevo — recommended: https://app.brevo.com  →  SMTP & API → create key
#     Verify sender in Brevo (domain or “From”) so MAIL_FROM is allowed.
#     If set, this overrides generic SMTP_HOST below.
# BREVO_SMTP_LOGIN=your-brevo-account@email.com
# BREVO_SMTP_KEY=xkeysib-...
# MAIL_FROM="Карточки" <noreply@yourdomain.com>
#
# (B) Mail.ru — use “Пароль для внешнего приложения” in mailbox settings, then
#     from address must be that mailbox (or allowed alias).
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.mail.ru
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_SECURE=true
# SMTP_USER=you@mail.ru
# SMTP_PASS=external-app-password
# SMTP_TLS_INSECURE=false
# MAIL_FROM="Карточки" <you@mail.ru>
#
# (C) Local Docker Postfix (flashcards-postfix) — for production add RELAY, SPF, DKIM.
# SMTP_HOST=flashcards-postfix
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_TLS_INSECURE=true
# MAIL_FROM="Карточки" <noreply@kzt24.duckdns.org>
#
# (stub) If neither Brevo keys nor SMTP_HOST is set, codes go to: docker logs flashcards-api
